"macOS's own translation: Chinese appears almost at once. Line by line, without the earlier lines or the glossary. Download the languages first in System Settings → General → Language & Region → Translation Languages." = "macOS 内置的翻译：中文几乎立刻出现。逐句翻译，不看上文也不使用术语表。请先前往“系统设置 → 通用 → 语言与地区 → 翻译语言”下载语言包。";
