"✓ The voice models are on this Mac." = "✓ 声纹模型已在这台 Mac 上。";
"補對照: a line without its meaning gets its Chinese; a line written in Chinese gets the words to read aloud." = "补对照：没有中文意思的句子补上中文；用中文写的句子补上要念的外语。";
"Next update: any moment" = "下次更新：随时";
"Update" = "更新频率";
"A fast, cheap model is enough. \"Same as replies\" is the one chosen under Translation, or with Apple Translation or TranslateGemma the first with a key, else Gemma 4." = "用又快又便宜的模型就够了。“与回复相同”就是“翻译”中选择的模型；选择 Apple 翻译或 TranslateGemma 时，使用第一个有密钥的，都没有则用 Gemma 4。";
"Counted from the last update, and only once there are at least %@ new lines, so a quiet stretch is skipped. The last lines are summarized when listening stops." = "从上次更新起算，而且要有至少 %@ 行新字幕才更新，所以安静的时段会跳过。停止聆听时会把最后几行也整理进摘要。";
"During a meeting, Update Now in the Summary window brings the summary up to date at once, and the interval can be changed there too." = "会议中点按摘要窗口的“立即更新”可以马上更新摘要，也可以在那里修改更新频率。";
"Every minute" = "每分钟";
