"Next update: when one more line is in" = "下次更新：再有 1 行新字幕时";
"Nothing is summarized until you press Update Now in the Summary window, not even when listening stops." = "在摘要窗口点按“立即更新”之前不会生成摘要，停止聆听时也不会。";
